er if we've ever seen  one believe it or not but some fans were  a little upset to find out that Pixar  was coming out with a fourth choice  story movie this is because they believe  that Toy Story 3 summed up the franchise  on a high note and while they might be  right  we hope that Pixar proves us wrong by  delivering the best Toy Story movie yet  so are you eager to see the upcoming  film if so let us know which new  character you're most excited for in the  comments below and that's a wrap  thanks for watching and see you next  time on the things  [Music]

